  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Appraisal Rammeprogram DK statistik</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Based on the newly developed Sector Support Cooperation (SSC) guidelines for framework agreements between the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and Danish sector ministries, agencies and city administrations two initial 4-year framework programmes with Danish sector ministries are being formulated and appraised. Within this context, the objective of the current appraisal is to assess the SSC framework programme with Statistics Denmark and make recommendations for its finalization and presentation to the Council for Development Policy.</narrative>
  </description>
